{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"SsfStatusActor"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"open","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" enum. A value this SDK’s copy of the spec does not list decodes to "},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rather than failing the response it arrived in (CONTRACT.md §27.11 rule 1). Throwing there"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fails the WHOLE response, so one field of one record would take down the page it was on,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"including the records the caller did ask for."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is never read as one of the KNOWN cases: reading a new value as whichever case happens to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"be first turns a new server state into a wrong one, and on this surface these values gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"access. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":"’s own raw value is the empty string, which no server value is, so"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" is never written: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encode(to:)"},{"type":"text","text":" refuses it locally, before any request, as a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"validation failure (CONTRACT.md §34.2 P12.2, contract 1.60 A4) — never as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"\""},{"type":"text","text":", never left"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the server to refuse. A "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"switch"},{"type":"text","text":" over these cases needs an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":" arm."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/ssfstatusactor"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Enumeration","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"SsfStatusActor"}],"symbolKind":"enum","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SsfStatusActor","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","title":"SsfStatusActor","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK14SsfStatusActorO"},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s12CaseIterableP","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/Se","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SE","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SQ","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SH","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/SY","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Who set a stream’s current status. A status an administrator set to anything but ","type":"text"},{"code":"enabled","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"cannot be changed by the receiver (D-51).","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfStatusActor"},"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Enumeration Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfStatusActor\/admin","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfStatusActor\/receiver","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfStatusActor\/unknown"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases"},{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfStatusActor\/init(from:)","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/SsfStatusActor\/init(rawValue:)"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Initializers"},{"title":"Instanc